<title>UK: LME aluminum firmer, copper steady in pre-market.</title>
<headline>LME aluminum firmer, copper steady in pre-market.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Just firmer after an LME stocks draw of 1,750 tonnes.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Stronger, comfortably above $1,600 level. Stocks decline of 3,400 underpinning market. ZINC - Stable around $1,370. TIN - Off Friday's highs, eases below $5,700.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Little changed.</p>
</text>
